// endpoint_notify_workspace.proto — NotifyWorkspace: an agent posts a desktop
// banner attributed to a workspace (its own or another's), whose click brings
// Emacs forward and selects that workspace. AGENT API section.
//
// THE BANNER IS THE DAEMON'S OWN. It is posted through the same notifier as
// every other banner (internal/desktopnotify): titled by the target
// workspace's name, the request's message below it, grouped with the target's
// other banners so it replaces the previous one, ringing the banner chime, and
// held for a focus gain's claim. So the rule every banner obeys holds here
// too: a focused Emacs gets no banner, and the answer says so.

